---

<section id="cases" class="organization-cases section-shell" aria-labelledby="organization-cases-title">
  <div class="section-heading split-heading">
    <div><p class="kicker">05 / ORGANIZATIONAL CASES</p><h2 id="organization-cases-title">AIを、組織で使える<br />開発の流れへ。</h2></div>
    <p>ツールの選定だけではなく、小さな検証、展開、計測、学習までを一つの導入プロセスとして扱った公開事例です。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="organization-case-list">
    {cases.map((item) => (
      <article class="organization-case">
        <div class="organization-case-head"><span>{item.no}</span><p class="kicker">{item.label}</p></div>
        <div class="organization-case-main">
          <h3>{item.title}</h3>
          <p>{item.description}</p>
          <a class="text-link" href={item.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{item.linkLabel} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="case-metric"><strong>{item.metric}</strong><span>{item.metricLabel}</span><p>{item.note}</p></div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>
